  "_about": "How each franchise guide treats series order in Play next. Ids are IGDB game ids (see site/franchises.json). story: saga = one continuous plot, every earlier main game counts (except opt); arcs = separate story arcs, each a saga of its own (games listed in play order; a remake listed in an arc keeps that place); loose = standalone stories, only earlier must-plays count (score 88+, the first main game, or ess) plus explicit after links; none = play in any order. ess: never skipped for a low score. opt: fine to skip. after: {game: [games it needs first]}, also for spin-offs. Franchises not listed here are loose. Curated by Claude; a weekly check flags new franchises and games. reviewed: entry ids already looked at in saga/arcs franchises; a new game in those franchises (not listed) goes on the to-do list in franchises.json (curation_todo) for the weekly check.",
